  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a reader, I want the in-topic search to offer \"Filtrer les messages\" and \"Résultats suivants\" like legacy, so that parity with `TopicSearchSheetView` (GAP-135, GAP-136) is complete. LOT-113 (#204) shipped the sheet without them.\n\n### Scope\n\nCaptures (`host: mac`, read the LOT-001 kit, anonymized, never hand-built):\n\n- `transsearch.php` POST **without `p`** (LOT-113's sheet omits the form's hidden `p`; legacy and `R52a` sent it).\n- `transsearch.php` POST **with `filter=1`** (answer not captured; `R122c`/`R122d` are the GET).\n- A continued search (`firstnum`/`currentnum`), a bad token, a logged-out session, and a private conversation (`cat=prive`).\n\nThen app work: the filter toggle (a plain GET of the `Location` + `filter=1` needs a reader source that takes a query) and \"Résultats suivants\".\n\nRefs: #204, `docs/lots/LOT-113-topic-search.md` (Pending capture), `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md` §7 E28.\n",
